components.what:
On startup, clear and compact the hook injects:
- up to 10,000 chars of recent observations (50 by default);
- a 3 KB memory-instruction block: proactively save_memory preferences and decisions, output-style rules, and four runtime variants;
- a work-state rule that replaces the host's to-do tool;
- promo copy.
The block is not framed as data, and telemetry reports whether the rule was returned.
